---`ExtensionBinding` is a resource representing the attachment of an extension to a service.
---@class gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.ExtensionBinding
---@field name? string Identifier. Name of the `ExtensionBinding` resource in the following format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/extensionBindings/{extension_binding}`.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.StringMap Optional. Set of labels associated with the `ExtensionBinding` resource. The format must comply with [the following requirements](https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/labeling-resources#requirements).
---@field producerExtension? string Required. The name of the extension that this binding should attach to target resources. Format: * For Google-provided extensions, specify the service endpoint, for example `modelarmor.us-central1.rep.googleapis.com`.
---@field matchConditions? gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.ExtensionBindingMatchConditionList Optional. A list of match conditions to evaluate against the incoming request. The extension is invoked if the request matches at least one condition, or if no match conditions are specified. A request matches a condition only if it matches every field that is set in that condition. Limited to 5 conditions.
---@field target? gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.ExtensionBindingTarget Required. Specifies a target to which this `ExtensionBinding` should be attached.
---@field producerMetadata? gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.StringMap Optional. Additional metadata that should be passed to the attached extension with each request. This field is subject to the following limitations: * The total size of the metadata must be less than 1 KiB. * The total number of keys must be less than 16. * The length of each key must be less than 64 characters. * The length of each value must be less than 1024 characters.
---@field etag? string Optional. Etag of the resource. If provided, it must match the server's etag. If the provided etag does not match the server's etag, the request will fail with a 409 ABORTED error.
---@field failOpen? boolean Optional. Determines the behavior of the extension binding when the call to the extension fails or times out. Default value is `false`. When set to `true`, failures of the extension are silently ignored.
---@field description? string Optional. A human-readable description of the resource.
---@field priority? number Optional. This field is not supported.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when the resource was created.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when the resource was updated.

---@alias gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.ExtensionBindingList gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.ExtensionBinding[]

