---@class gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.ExtensionBindingMatchCondition
---@field to? gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.ExtensionBindingMatchConditionTo Optional. Describes properties of a destination of a request. If specified, the extension will only be invoked on requests to destinations that match the specified criteria.

---Determines how an HTTP header should be matched.
