---@field details? gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.DocumentMapList A list of messages that carry the error details. There is a common set of message types for APIs to use.
---@field code? number The status code, which should be an enum value of google.rpc.Code.

---@alias gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.StringList string[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.networkservices_v1beta1.StringMap { [string]: string }

---TcpRoute is the resource defining how TCP traffic should be routed by a Mesh/Gateway resource.
