---@field pluginConfigData? string Configuration for the plugin. The configuration is provided to the plugin at runtime through the `ON_CONFIGURE` callback. When a new `WasmPluginVersion` resource is created, the digest of the contents is saved in the `plugin_config_digest` field.
---@field description? string Optional. A human-readable description of the resource.

